  "simulation_requirement": "Using the uploaded files 'DBS Background & Context.pdf' (brand history baseline), 'Humans of DBS Context.md' (post context), and 'CPE Metric Weighting.txt' (algorithmic conversion logic) as context:\r\n\r\nThe file 'post_caption.txt' contains the text copy of the Facebook post, and 'image_1.md' to 'image_5.md' are the attached visual creative asset.\r\n\r\nPredict how this specific Facebook post will perform after being published. The output report must provide the predicted Cost Per Engagement (CPE) tier alongside a granular conversion funnel breakdown (Scroll-pasts, Likes, Caption Clicks, Comments, and Shares) in terms of both percentages and the actual stats and an analysis of archetype response variance.",
