  "event_config": {
    "initial_posts": [
      {
        "content": "From the cockpit to the coding desk! Derek Ang's journey from the Air Force to our Remittance team shows that the right path isn't always a straight line. Discover how he's navigating his new flight path at DBS. #HumansOfDBS #LifeAtDBS",
        "poster_type": "Organization",
        "poster_agent_id": 1
      },
      {
        "content": "It’s inspiring to see Derek’s transition. Career pivots can be daunting, but stories like this show that skills from different industries—like the discipline from the Air Force—are highly valuable in tech and banking. Truly a testament to lifelong learning!",
        "poster_type": "AcademicInstitution",
        "poster_agent_id": 10
      },
      {
        "content": "As a colleague, I’ve seen how Derek brings that same mission-critical mindset from his aviation days to our tech projects. Proud to have him on the team! #DBSPride",
        "poster_type": "BankEmployee",
        "poster_agent_id": 12
